    "status": "active",
    "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=14.3,147.8",
    "official_link": "https://www.google.com/maps?q=14.3,147.8",
    "country_code": null,
    "payload": {
      "item_type": "disturbance",
      "source": "jtwc_abpw",
      "source_key": "jtwc_abpw|western_north_pacific_area|invest_95w",
      "content_hash": "00161d97aa7b7c56",
      "platform_summary": "14.3N 147.8E | winds 23-28 kt | 1007 mb | MEDIUM",
      "platform_location": "14.3N 147.8E",
      "wind": "23-28 kt",
      "risk_48h": null,
      "risk_7d": null,
      "next_update": null,
      "raw_text": "(1) THE AREA OF CONVECTION (INVEST 95W) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR \n14.0N 146.7E IS NOW LOCATED NEAR 14.3N 147.8E, APPROXIMATELY 73 NM \nEAST-NORTHEAST OF GUAM. ANIMATED ENHANCED INFRARED (EIR) SATELLITE \nIMAGERY DEPICTS A SLOWLY CONSOLIDATING LOW LEVEL CIRCULATION WITH \nFLARING CONVECTION TO THE SOUTH AND EAST. ANALYSIS OF THE LOW-LEVEL \nCLOUD BANDS INDICATE THAT 95W LIKELY DOES NOT HAVE A CLOSED \nCIRCULATION AND RESEMBLES A TROUGH. RECENT SCATTEROMETER DATA \nINDICATED 25 KT WINDS IN THE SOUTHEAST QUADRANT. ENVIRONMENTAL \nANALYSIS INDICATES A FAVORABLE AREA FOR DEVELOPMENT WITH MODERATE \nVERTICAL WIND SHEAR (15-20KTS), GOOD WESTWARD OUTFLOW, AND VERY WARM \nSEA SURFACE TEMPERATURES (29-30C). GLOBAL DETERMINISTIC AND ENSEMBLE \nMODELS AGREE ON A SLOW DEVELOPMENT TREND, AND THE SYSTEM COULD BECOME \nA TROPICAL DEPRESSION OUTSIDE OF 24 HOURS BUT WITHIN 48 HOURS AS IT \nTRACKS NORTHEASTWARD FOR THE NEXT 24-36 HOURS BEFORE CURVING SHARPLY \nNORTHWESTWARD. MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 23 TO \n28 KNOTS. MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1007 MB. \nTHE POTENTIAL FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE \nWITHIN THE NEXT 24 HOURS IS UPGRADED TO MEDIUM.",
      "metadata": {
        "basin_section": "WESTERN NORTH PACIFIC AREA (180 TO MALAY PENINSULA)",
        "invest_id": "95W",
        "lat": 14.3,
        "lon": 147.8,
        "wind_kt_min": 23,
        "wind_kt_max": 28,
        "wind_kt": 28,
        "pressure_mb": 1007,
        "development_phrase": "UPGRADED TO",
        "development_level": "MEDIUM",
        "bulletin_issue_at": "2026-10-10T14:30:00+00:00"
      }
    },
